nt": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Agreeing and Disagreeing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use different phrases to agree and disagree tactfully (politely).", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "At the workplace, we ask for others' opinion with questions such as:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul> <li>What do you think?</li> <li>I'm interested in your feedback/input.</li> <li>Please let me know your thoughts.</li> </ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We show agreement or disagreement with statements in the chart below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Agreeing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disagreeing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I agree with you 100 percent.</br> I couldn't agree with you more.</br> That's so true.</br> You're absolutely right.</br> Absolutely.</br> That's exactly how I feel.</br> Exactly.</br> You have a point there.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't think so.</br> I'm afraid I disagree.</br> I beg to differ.</br> Not necessarily.</br> That's not always true.</br> I'm not sure if ...</br> I see what you're saying, but ...</br> I don't know about that ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The First Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else will happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you cook the meat too long,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it will burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you will cook the meat too long. In this condition: it will burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I ask the teacher to help me,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible I will ask the teacher to help me. In this condition: I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If he gets a high-paying job,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he can go on a vacation twice a year.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible he will get a high-paying job. In this condition: he can go on vacation twice a year.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to miss someone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel that you want to be with someone but you can't", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: John misses Sally after not talking to her for a long time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Guess what?", "type": "name"}, {"content": "You say this before you te